    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16165" root="رفع" body-key="r">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُفَاعَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A string</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَيْط</span>) <i>whereby he who is
shackled</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُقَيَّد</span>) <i>raises his shackles</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَيْد</span>), (Yoo,
S, K,) <i>to which that string is fastened;</i> (TA;)
as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِفَاعَةٌ</span></b> . (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also, (S, K,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِفَاعَةٌ</span></b> ,
(Az, K,) <i>A thing by means of which a woman
having little flesh in the posteriors makes herself
to appear large</i> [<i>in that part</i>]; (S;) <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُظَّامَةٌ</span>:
(K:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَفَائِعُ</span>. (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَفَاعَةٌ</span>.

